*pack* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''pack(value)''

Converts a string or list of numbers to bytes.

*Parameters:*
- ''value'': String or list of numbers (0-255)

*Returns:*
- Bytes: Converted byte representation

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if value is not string or list
- Runtime error if list contains non-number elements
- Runtime error if list contains numbers outside 0-255 range
